     or a voice for which you hold explicit, documented consent from the person
     whose voice it is.

  2. You will not use VoiceMorph to impersonate any person without their
     consent, to defraud or deceive, or to bypass or defeat any voice-based
     authentication or identity-verification system.

  3. You will comply with all applicable laws and platform policies regarding
     synthetic media, likeness rights, and biometric data.

The authors and contributors provide this software for legitimate, consented
